# generated number-table dumps: the table.hpp GenerateTable() helpers write these into
# whatever the working directory is, which is the repo root when a test is run by hand
lns.txt
takums.txt
takum_logs.txt
posits.txt
cfloats.txt
fixpnts.txt
areals.txt
dbns.txt

# generated artifacts a demo or test writes into its working directory. The dumps below
# were committed by accident three times (#1432 and again in #1435) because tests were run
# from the repo root; the durable fix is to run them from a scratch directory, and these
# patterns are the backstop.
*.ppm
mandelbrot*.ppm
